│ (modified ILM flap) than in Group A. CONCLUSION The study results indicate that the temporal inverted ILM flap       │
│ technique is as effective as the classic inverted ILM flap technique for the repair of large Stage IV macular        │
│ holes."}, {"study_index": 20, "title": "Comparative evaluation of standard ILM peel with inverted ILM flap technique │
