- Study 17: RCT comparing two variations of inverted ILM flap technique (not ILM peeling vs inverted flap)
- Study 19: RCT comparing temporal vs classic inverted ILM flap technique (not ILM peeling vs inverted flap)

*Methodological Papers (2):*
